00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:23.670
Those are the buildings
where we hold our classes.

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:24.550
That's where you'll be for

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:27.800
two weeks, learning about how
to be innovative marketers.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.029
Let's go visit a classroom.

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:31.899
[MUSIC]

00:00:31.899 --> 00:00:37.924
This is one of our typical classrooms,
beautiful and state of the art.

00:00:37.924 --> 00:00:44.009
[MUSIC]

00:00:44.009 --> 00:00:46.994
So we're coming on the beautiful
Schwab Residential Center.

00:00:46.994 --> 00:00:48.927
[MUSIC]

00:00:48.927 --> 00:00:50.928
Also see our signature palm trees.

00:00:50.928 --> 00:00:54.018
[MUSIC]

00:00:54.018 --> 00:00:56.200
Here we go the Schwab Residential Center.

00:00:57.680 --> 00:01:04.200
The GSB is know for having excellent food
in its executive education programs.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:08.690
So here we are, this is the courtyard
where you'll be meeting your

00:01:08.690 --> 00:01:13.660
fellow participants, and
having three meals a day.

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:17.240
Three extremely nutritious,
highly caloric meals.

00:01:18.940 --> 00:01:22.337
So part of the program also includes
guest lectures and in the evening.

00:01:22.337 --> 00:01:26.249
Different start up entrepreneurs,
sometimes different investors,

00:01:26.249 --> 00:01:30.093
sometimes professors in other
departments in the school that present

00:01:30.093 --> 00:01:31.732
