00:01:31.732 --> 00:01:34.900
Have a meal in addition to a lecture.

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:41.070
The Romans said,
healthy mind, healthy body.

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:44.240
So here in our programs,
we take care of both of your mind,

00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:47.374
bviously through our immersive
work in the class rooms.

00:01:47.374 --> 00:01:52.073
But also of your body,
with our meals and, of course, our gym.

00:01:52.073 --> 00:01:53.370
Hey guys, how is it going?

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:56.930
A beautiful library is just up ahead.

00:01:56.930 --> 00:01:59.580
Classrooms are to my left and to my right.

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:01.070
Oops, stay on the path.

00:02:01.070 --> 00:02:03.399
They don't like it here
when you step on the grass.

00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:06.812
